sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant D as PostgreSQL

    B->>A: POST /auth/login with credentials
    A->>D: lock user and verify active status
    A->>D: create session family and refresh session
    A-->>B: access token plus HttpOnly session cookie
    Note over B: Browser keeps an opaque cookie and no refresh token in local storage
    B->>A: POST /auth/browser-session with X-CampusLoop-Browser
    A->>A: validate origin and cookie
    A->>D: load non-revoked family and apply refresh window
    A->>D: append browser_session_restored audit record
    A-->>B: new access token and current user
    B->>A: authenticated API request with bearer access token
    A-->>B: protected response
